    {
      "id": "ac3b0acf-9a0c-43b9-9e3a-165f803508f7",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe o papel de al final no desfecho.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2d4ee2ca-31e9-43db-bd36-4ae05fcbc88f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Al final...</strong> leva a anedota para o resultado.</p><p>Depois dele, basta dizer como tudo terminou, sem recontar cada passo do problema.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e0e9839b-f3e6-4906-869a-1efde2e4fce7",
      "title": "Uma anedota curta com suspense",
      "description": "<p>Veja como o gancho, a revelação e o desfecho entram em uma troca curta sem deixar a história pesada.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">No te imaginas lo que nos pasó en el cine de verano.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Você nem imagina o que aconteceu com a gente no cinema ao ar livre.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/386fb3cde84c4c27b9e6b9a1c3094222_b02-no-te-imaginas-cine-de-verano.mp3?Expires=1794099597&Signature=co3sfHKVSYTxJsnLb6nClar4yEn2~y6KxFPhDSITE2d2nu0zRYYXYvS89g3pDmmSdOQCcDvncqD~~oomomqJJS18b718NduaG7fiuRSGaD5GVQrDKM8yZYbEBDTSDAt0vvspjA7iuNgaOkH4xtjrOGTHITqP-TwbcgUMZUZA6TwHxFgK5V4aLpZt1DSWZAxWiOXd2RYk8gAwbqeSVooa-FHaqk-yv4AVpiBEm1PdOOrZ0gs3qYG~WkIfl5IYXXE7S90mXeM6rah3S-qDEJqCKFJNXiuc~Z44iAZTEOUQC3~0OoHdkLenILQyd0ooG5QSVEoeHJ7E1LV49CvM0Jwqwg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Qué pasó?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">O que aconteceu?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/cb84c5bfc04840889e7821f9f9717e75_b08-dialogo-que-paso.mp3?Expires=1794099597&Signature=rHCbMYPLfbhErr2uH-IX7uToBao~9I~SQNbliRjPi9KkwcLH~tQk0uXTjMdV4nZylrTfoAv~dHawcV1inVJ7lGe0vvDSiD4ykl~6byqGpDSsnr9y226wcK5XQZj2Y2u24k5RbGEcbUfHXN3fUFCBHiCkurqQwyl8g91bfYdbJWg9oYJuNV2AJkNNvmaAGSMEqls5L8AiI5XshC3ATflAuo74hG8LgBtktiXLvlHpvSF3ZOsS2O5kkYdFf0gwHPSqnoW0jIhaq0ysoCqhRGm7W0p11OOy88257hQOnj6FyMMN2IvdwkXB-2QjaZfpNI1kEm3HT7iB0h6qt8O8UqDJdw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Resulta que yo había guardado las entradas para el día siguiente.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Acontece que eu tinha guardado os ingressos para o dia seguinte.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5334b6c9b61641328d9bf84bc1a8008d_b04-resulta-que-entradas-dia-siguiente.mp3?Expires=1794099597&Signature=R3MhPpKgSrIPWK2bVCUXrQyyOy1XySRLCy9ReA02iDbsPdaFJseHdbKMfy~i3exLMWUytYhPy~I8mkALmA3KlU13R6NpXU1-hLVQnBPlyq~ZWhNzgUOQLR75mJ1h9PoXwp60iHkgMQB5jyFnM2FtRMHXiZZ19W-y9rgXC2A4FNL1GwBvoVoDQdbJjZFmY3BfNEahsEpgHbOu770~C6JbAJqsmF~~lKDlDupfgscPt0jWmvxlcqcYdbQdEq2FgAV0aen~Rzy7I5r6Inzf~DnXfb6z9xGIUv~WOVI82b0bzGnhC2XqLKGzjUMU9u9EX7TAQfztrEB6MoWB3zxKygj1Jw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
